					"nextDialogs": [
						401120602
					],
					"speakerTitle": "可莉"
				},
				{
					"id": 401120602,
					"content": "亲眼看到还是很震撼…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401120603
					],
					"speakerTitle": "柯莱"
				},
				{
					"id": 401120603,
					"content": "确实是相当壮观的景象。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401120604
					],
					"speakerTitle": "凯亚"
				},
				{
					"id": 401120604,
					"content": "……",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401120605
					],
					"speakerTitle": "优菈"
				},
				{
					"id": 401120605,
					"content": "怎么了，觉得不舒服吗？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401120606
					],
					"speakerTitle": "柯莱"
				},
				{
					"id": 401120606,
					"content": "不，只是一瞬间有点难适应，这里的空气有些干燥…相较于蒙德…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401120607
					],
					"speakerTitle": "优菈"
				},
				{
					"id": 401120607,
					"content": "这里可不像能住人的样子，如果真的有个秘境…附近似乎也没见到入口？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401120608
					],
					"speakerTitle": "优菈"
				},
				{
					"id": 401120608,
					"content": "难道是因为我、我刚才念错了…应该不至于吧…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401120609
					],
					"speakerTitle": "柯莱"
				},
				{
					"id": 401120609,
					"content": "没有错哦！绝对不是因为柯莱姐姐！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401120610
					],
					"speakerTitle": "可莉"
				},
				{
					"id": 401120610,
					"content": "之前可莉也不小心念错，但还是到了化城郭！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401120611
					],
					"speakerTitle": "可莉"
				},
				{
					"id": 401120611,
					"content": "按照之前的经验，目的地不会有错。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401120612
					],
					"speakerTitle": "凯亚"
				},
				{
					"id": 401120612,
					"content": "呼…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401120613
					],
					"speakerTitle": "柯莱"
				},
				{
					"id": 401120613,
					"content": "那是不是藏在附近沙丘下面了呢？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401120614
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 401120614,
					"content": "…没有办法，只能先寻找一下看看了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401120615
					],
					"speakerTitle": "优菈"
				},
				{
					"id": 401120615,
					"content": "众人分头寻找，可惜找了许久还是没有头绪。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_BLACK_SCREEN",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401120616
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 401120616,
					"content": "好累，而且好渴…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401120617
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 401120617,
					"content": "不应该。难道「神奇邀请函」突然出了问题？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401120618
					],
					"speakerTitle": "凯亚"
				},
				{
					"id": 401120618,
					"content": "咦？怎么会这样…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401120619
					],
					"speakerTitle": "可莉"
				},
				{
					"id": 401120619,
					"content": "啊，不会是被可莉弄坏了吧？但可莉什么都没做呀…嘟嘟可能作证的！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401120620
					],
					"speakerTitle": "可莉"
				},
				{
					"id": 401120620,
					"content": "肯定也不是可莉的问题，你看，这张纸都没有皱。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401120621
					],
					"speakerTitle": "柯莱"
				},
				{
					"id": 401120621,
					"content": "如果那个秘境在附近…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401120622
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 401120622,
					"content": "#嗯？难道荣誉骑士{M#哥哥}{F#姐姐}有办法了吗！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401120623
					],
					"speakerTitle": "可莉"
				},
				{
					"id": 401120623,
					"content": "与其让我们找秘境！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401120624
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 401120624,
					"content": "#啊，我明白了{NICKNAME}的意思了！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401120625
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 401120625,
					"content": "嗯，不如让秘境来找我们。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401120626
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 401120626,
					"content": "这倒是个有趣的思路，既然「神奇邀请函」就在这里…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401120627
					],
					"speakerTitle": "凯亚"
				},
				{
					"id": 401120627,
					"content": "送出邀请函的秘境，与它也必然存在联系。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401120628
					],
					"speakerTitle": "凯亚"
				},
				{
					"id": 401120628,
					"content": "噢，那可莉明白了。其实可莉也有绝招的！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401120629
					],
					"speakerTitle": "可莉"
				},
				{
					"id": 401120629,
					"content": "什么样的绝招？我们能学吗？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401120630
					],
					"speakerTitle": "优菈"
				},
				{
					"id": 401120630,
					"content": "可以的！妈妈提过，需要帮助的时候就这样大声喊出来——",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401120631
					],
					"speakerTitle": "可莉"
				},
				{
					"id": 401120631,
					"content": "「神奇邀请函」，「神奇邀请函」，可莉需要帮助！想想办法吧！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401120632
					],
					"speakerTitle": "可莉"
				},
				{
					"id": 401120632,
					"content": "#快看！{NICKNAME}，有什么东西真的飞过来了！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401120633
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 401120633,
					"content": "欸？那是…一个瓶子？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401120634
					],
					"speakerTitle": "优菈"
				},
				{
					"id": 401120634,
					"content": "很有效呢，我打算学学这招傍身用。你也学一下吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401120635
					],
					"speakerTitle": "凯亚"
				},
				{
					"id": 401120635,
					"content": "不要！太不适合我了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401120636
					],
					"speakerTitle": "优菈"
				},
				{
					"id": 401120636,
					"content": "瓶子在须弥也算是经常出现在传说中的东西了…难道这个就是秘境的入口吗？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401120637
					],
					"speakerTitle": "柯莱"
				},
				{
					"id": 401120637,
					"content": "秘境在瓶子里，听上去也是在璃月发生过的事。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401120638
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 401120638,
					"content": "#真是这样的话，那进去的方法就只有一种了！来吧，伸出你的手{NICKNAME}！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401120639
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 401120639,
					"content": "（触碰瓶子…）",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": []
				}
